    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><span class="text-2xl font-bold">3.9/5</span><span class="text-gray-500">Global cloud VPS rating</span></div><p class="text-gray-300">HostNOC is a Texas-based hosting provider (founded 2018) selling SSD-backed cloud VPS across Singapore, Hong Kong, France, and the Netherlands, plus dedicated servers in 6 US metros. The headline HN-SSD VPS line is currently running a 60% promotion, putting entry plans at $12.75/month with full root access, DDoS protection, and 24/7 support.</p><p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Sale entry: $12.75/mo HN-SSD I (4 GB RAM, 300 GB SSD) · regular $31.875/mo</p></div>
